## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to translate a feature into a concrete CBA with privacy constraints, rollout strategy, and measurable ROI.

## Key Concepts

- On-device perceptual hashing
- Memory and CPU budgeting for fingerprint indices
- Data savings vs latency trade-offs
- Privacy/compliance, consent flows
- Rollout plans, offline fallback, drift maintenance, ROI calculation

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo: fingerprint a media item and decide upload
function shouldUpload(media) {
  const fp = perceptualFingerprint(media);
  const exists = fingerprintIndex.has(fp);
  if (exists) return false;
  fingerprintIndex.add(fp);
  return true;
}
```

## Follow-up Questions

- How would you measure and validate data savings at scale?
- How handle hash collisions and index eviction?
- What telemetry would you collect for ROI without compromising privacy?

